{"seq":37,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:30:39.179Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f93c7a55afd5a7e65cfa6cbb74ab16151abe77879734842edbef6d6899c51acc","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"north-team","text":"Dana, it's 19 November. Marcus first posted 21 December here on 14 Oct, then posted a correction in #north-random later that morning: the deadline for the signed order form at Thornbury Cloth Co. is 19 November, and he'd read the wrong line the first time. I haven't seen anything since that changes it, so 19 November is the date for the tracker. Heads-up: his 21 December message here hasn't been edited, and my earlier reply to it also says 21 December.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1792159200.000133","thread_ts":"1792159200.000132"}}
{"seq":38,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:30:44.533Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9eb5533d30fd344596541daf1094a872a2f2c875bd63067c55a9c34b94c4ebde","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I replied to Dana in a thread on her #north-team message: the agreed deadline for the signed order form at Thornbury Cloth Co. is **19 November**.\n\n- **How it got there:** On 14 Oct Marcus posted 21 December in #north-team. That same morning he posted a correction in #north-random saying the date is 19 November and that he'd read the wrong line. I read both channels and found nothing later that changes the date. The brain also has the correction saved.\n- **Dana could see it herself:** She's a member of both channels, so passing on Marcus's correction doesn't share anything she couldn't already read. A signing deadline is also an operational fact, not a finance figure.\n- **Correction to my earlier reply:** When Marcus posted 21 December, I told him I'd found nothing that said otherwise. That was wrong, because his 19 November correction was already posted. Both his original message and my reply in #north-team still show 21 December. I pointed that out to Dana, but I haven't edited or posted anything else there. Marcus may want to correct his message in #north-team so nobody else picks up the old date."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1792159200.000134"}}
